WEBVTT

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:30.240
He smalled up.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.736
I've had to also let go
of magical thinking --

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:37.736
this idea that if I just
was patient enough

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.016
and tightened my belt

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.416
that things would go back to normal.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.576
If I just sent in one more CV

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:48.816
or applied to one more job online

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:51.656
or attended one more networking event

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:54.720
that surely I'd get the kind of job
I was used to having.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:58.040
Surely things would return to normal.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:03.496
The truth is I'm not going back
and neither are you.